OL,5,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor the last time to settle some
OL,9,     Fscores. There's anger as well as
OL,10,     Ftears of joy when the winner is
OL,11,     Frevealed.
OL,12,G2100 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FPatients on the nightshift include
OL,14,     Fa stabbing victim, an 86-year-old
OL,15,     Fwoman who's spent her life alone,
OL,16,     Fand a former lawyer who's lost his
OL,17,     Fwife, family and home to
OL,18,     Falcoholism.
